{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_115_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"一、元年，春，王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"繼故而言即位，與聞乎故也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"二、公子遂如齊逆女。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"三、三月，遂以夫人婦姜至自齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"其不言氏，喪未畢，故略之也。其曰婦，緣姑言之之辭也。遂之挈由上致之也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"四、夏，季孫行父如齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"五、晉放其大夫胥甲父於衞。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"放，猶屏也。稱國以放，放無罪也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"六、公會齊侯於平州。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"七、公子遂如齊。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"八、六月，齊人取濟西田。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"內不言取，言取，授之也，以是為賂齊也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"九、秋，邾子來朝。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"十、楚子、鄭人侵陳，遂侵宋。晉趙盾帥師救陳。宋公、陳侯、衞侯、曹伯會晉師於棐林，伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"遂，繼事也。善救陳也。列數諸侯而會晉趙盾，大趙盾之事也。其曰師何也？以其大之也。於棐林，地而從伐鄭，疑辭也。此其地何？則著其美也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"十一、冬，晉趙穿帥師侵崇。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_115_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_115","textTraditional":"十二、晉人、宋人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}